  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nSettings / Options for Audio related things aren't really consistent.   \nBasically, in the Audio Tab of the Quick Menu or Main Menu we have both a Volume Slider and a Mute / Toggle button for each audio option / setting. This is not the case in other parts of the Menu. (see Attachments below)\nMy biggest complaint here are the HUD Audio Settings, for the Notification sounds we only have a toggle / mute button but no volume slider. For the Mic Toggle Sound we only have a volume slider.\n# Suggestion:\nConsider adding a volume slider to the Notification Sound and a separate `Play Mic Toggle Sound` toggle. This would make it more consistent with how other Audio Settings are done (e.g. Chatbox Notification Sound) and would allow users to separately change the Notification Sound volume, as well as Quickly turn the Mic Toggle Sound off.\n# Attachments:\nHere screenshots of different Audio Settings throughout the UI:",
